  <item>
    <title>EP.11 做个悠闲的特种兵！就来嘉兴CITY WALK~</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e63b455ca6d0ace30cb93f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e63b455ca6d0ace30cb93f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 15 Sep 2024 01:41:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>@秋葵大人 - 热情好客的朋友圈大片缔造者</span></p><span></span><p><span>@奥麦琪不骄傲 - 南湖三件套拥护者、烟雨楼站姐</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>夏天录制的节目带着还未散去的暑气来了！打工人或许没有暑假，但中秋国庆这不就来了么~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，两位主播再次回到熟悉的嘉兴，说完美食说旅游。有江南七怪严选景点，有秋葵精选出片指南~来嘉兴，不只有大家熟悉的南湖、乌镇，聊着聊着我们真是感慨，嘉兴这city太适合舒舒服服地walk了！节目的后半段，我们还为朋友们“精心”设计了三天两夜的假日短途~ 欢迎大家来嘉兴！吃好喝好玩的好~</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听~</span></p><span></span><p><span>温馨提示：微博、小红书搜索“</span><strong><span>秋葵大人</span></strong><span>”、“</span><strong><span>蛮灵光的</span></strong><span>”~可以收获更多灵光分享！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-时间线-</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">04:50</a>- 江南七怪和那个男人的严选！你值得拥有~</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="608">10:08</a>- 南湖边的“嘉兴太古里”</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a>- 市中心的古城墙，city walk开始啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a>- 羊毛衫购物指南 一年四季的双十一？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1872">31:12</a>- 谁在那头？！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a>- 出片又好吃！月河逛吃指南</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2471">41:11</a>- 尊贵来宾三天两夜 奥麦琪精选路线！（dada here！）</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a>- 被J人硬控的一天 从早上九点起床开始！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a>- 王老师 看这里！您的美容休闲网红之旅马上开始~</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4167">69:27</a>- 四十度高温徒步？四次化妆终于出门！</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>收听方式</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>目前本节目在：网易云音乐/小宇宙，都可以收听啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎订阅~</span></p>]]></description>
