  <item>
    <title>EP.10 婚姻这场游戏 吃苦可以 吃亏不行！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b5cf0f33591c27bee07639</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b5cf0f33591c27bee07639</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 09 Aug 2024 08:10:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>@秋葵大人 - 已婚女士秋葵</span></p><span></span><p><span>@奥麦琪不骄傲 - 单身女士麦琪</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期特邀嘉宾</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>ECHO - 律所合伙人</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>明天就是七夕啦～牛郎织女一年一度鹊桥相会！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本是每年常规会晤，王母都没有那么care，秋葵和麦琪却为牛郎织女操碎了心。这牛郎的牛是夫妻共同财产吗？婚前婚后的房子到底归属哪方？织女副业出了自传，这钱算夫妻双方所有吗？受法律保护的婚姻关系，我们又了解多少呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目特别邀请EHCO律师与我们一起聊聊结婚和离婚中的法律知识。牛郎织女，今年相逢可以先来签个婚内协议吧～</span></p><span></span><p><span>预祝大家七夕快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>愿我们穿过那道窄门～欢迎收听~</span></p><span></span><p><span>温馨提示：微博、小红书搜索“</span><strong><span>秋葵大人</span></strong><span>”、“</span><strong><span>蛮灵光的</span></strong><span>”~可以收获更多灵光分享！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-时间线-</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">03:25</a>- 夫妻情比金坚，房子展开说说</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="555">09:15</a>- 房子别卖！还是别买？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a>- 牛郎的牛是夫妻共同财产吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a>- 又能写小说，又会中彩票，到底是谁啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a>- 牛郎织女，今晚婚内协议先签一下吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1425">23:45</a>- “今日说法”第一案</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a>- 七夕仪式感的必要性！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1988">33:08</a>- 彩礼三金带来的“今日说法”第二案</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2505">41:45</a>- 因为“姓”还能离婚？！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2680">44:40</a>- 这法律意识强的有效吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3170">52:50</a>- 古希腊掌管亲密关系的神让我们拥抱一下</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3380">56:20</a>- 带着安全感的小勺，关关难过关关过！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4320">72:00</a>- 走过爱的怦然心动，我们一起穿过那道窄门</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>收听方式</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>目前本节目在：网易云音乐/小宇宙，都可以收听啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>努力周更！欢迎订阅~</span></p>]]></description>
