  <item>
    <title>EP.09 护肤美容十余年，三伏天还去做光子嫩肤？！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a9ec2833ddcbb53c57fba5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a9ec2833ddcbb53c57fba5</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 31 Jul 2024 07:47:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>@秋葵大人 - 混干敏感肌小葵，到底什么能把这泛红治一治啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span>@奥麦琪不骄傲 - 干皮不太敏感奥麦琪，超声炮什么时候再做？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期特邀嘉宾</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Kiki &nbsp;- &nbsp;Kaki Cafe主理人、奥麦琪的美容大王</span></p><span></span><p><span>Kaki Cafe：嘉兴市南湖区南溪西路2235号</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>你身边是否有这样一位朋友，不怕自当小白鼠，勇于尝试多种美容护理，能将美容称之为一项爱好！换季过敏、夏日闷痘、秋冬干燥，遇到任何和护肤美容相关的问题，她总能认真地与你分享和推荐~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们请来了爱好美容护肤的好朋友Kiki，奥麦琪珍藏十年的美容百宝书！畅谈日常护理有什么好物推荐？家用美容仪到底值不值得买？美容项目初体验又该注意哪些方面呢？本期节目，我们将一起聊聊那些年我们为美而作的努力，和心酸！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听~</span></p><span></span><p><span>温馨提示：微博、小红书搜索“</span><strong><span>秋葵大人</span></strong><span>”、“</span><strong><span>蛮灵光的</span></strong><span>”~可以收获更多灵光分享！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-时间线-</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="159">02:39</a>- 上海专家六字真言，本节目结束，谢谢大家</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">06:10</a>- 南湖区咖啡扛把子</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="628">10:28</a>- 祛斑一次到位？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a>- 高性价比的日常护理搭配</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a>- 精华油？那精华还用吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a>- 过敏肌面膜推荐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a>- 眼部护理的核心：心态好点</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">29:40</a>- 不要我知道，要你做到——多喝水！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2264">37:44</a>- 大排灯？Refa?家用器械买不买啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2925">48:45</a>- 瘦脸针=肉毒？初入医美不得不做的功课</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a>- 医美的关键选择！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3450">57:30</a>- 破皮项目的真诚建议</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3780">63:00</a>- 还得去那里啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【sp.由于设备问题，节目部分素材收音出现一点问题，请多包涵！技术不断进步中！】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>收听方式</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>目前本节目在：网易云音乐/小宇宙，都可以收听啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>努力周更！欢迎订阅~</span></p>]]></description>
