    <guid isPermaLink="false">6682b6af077b88831b847bb0</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jul 2024 14:01:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>@秋葵大人 -坚持创业的生活大哲学家——秋·小菲·葵</span></p><span></span><p><span>@奥麦琪不骄傲 -最近一直很害怕自己有班味的十年打工人</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>又是一年毕业季，欢迎莘莘学子开始生活大学的终身学习~本期节目两位主播将聊聊自己找工作的故事。有什么哭笑不得的坑需要避开？J人找工作的好方法又是什么？我们还会聊到，大小城市怎么选？大小公司又该去哪个？人生这旷野，怎么越走越狂野了？</span></p><span></span><p><span>不一定有用，希望能多点快乐~祝我们都不错！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听~</span></p><span></span><p><span>温馨提示：微博、小红书搜索“</span><strong><span>蛮灵光的</span></strong><span>”~可以收获更多灵光分享！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-时间线-</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">0:40</a>- 打工人开幕即开喷！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">8:00</a>- 一入财会深似海，就业到底好不好？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a>- 非酋找工作的技能输出</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a>- 听“小菲”奋不顾身投入时尚行业的故事~</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a>- 神仙老板我曾经拥有！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2105">35:05</a>- 看“恋爱大师”怎么找工作</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2268">37:48</a>- 致命危机！SOS！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2501">41:41</a>- 课代表整理笔记时间</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2720">45:20</a>- 需求五层塔？这个逼格我装上了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a>- 怎么获取关心的工作信息，YES OR NO？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3633">60:33</a>- 大城市VS小城市，大公司VS小公司</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4310">71:50</a>- 提高职场竞争力的小妙招</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4685">78:05</a>- 勇做职场“渣男”</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5060">84:20</a>- 当年埋下的种子，如今开出了花</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5438">90:38</a>- 子非我安知我行不行？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5465">91:05</a>- 人生这旷野，让我们越走越狂野！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>收听方式</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>目前本节目在：网易云音乐/小宇宙，都可以收听啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>努力周更！欢迎订阅~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本集相关</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtqmpzR6-9_nx_BuWkbyRA4A8lyE.png"></figure>]]></description>
