    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>@秋葵大人 -主打多维度防晒的品牌主理人，什么都要</span><strong><span>多加点葱</span></strong><span>！</span></p><span></span><p><span>@奥麦琪不骄傲 -热衷饮食防晒的推理小说爱好者，游泳就要河豚式蛙泳！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>炎炎夏日即将来袭！本期节目两位主播将畅聊夏天的故事，分享自己的夏日仪式感~两位主播将毫无保留地分享自己的防晒防蚊妙招（有些可能不妙！），分享自己探索到的新泳姿，解密红极一时家纺“背后的真相”！节目最后更有让主播透心凉的避暑好物在等着大家~</span></p><span></span><p><span>愿我们清凉一夏~欢迎收听~</span></p><span></span><p><span>温馨提示：微博、小红书搜索“</span><strong><span>蛮灵光的</span></strong><span>”~可以收获更多灵光分享！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-时间线-</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">1:50</a>- 多维度防晒好物分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">9:30</a>- 拿出战狼精神！和蚊子决斗！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a>- 玄学防蚊？养猫人的福音？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="945">15:45</a>- 换季收纳分享 这是我最别致的香味！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a>- 本节目特邀“专家”“深度解密”网红席子</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a>- 宫崎骏治愈了夏日，哈尔！治愈了我们！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a>- 海的外孙女VS 河豚泳者</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2210">36:50</a>- 预祝秋葵大人生日快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a>- 马尔代夫特别企划大揭秘！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2593">43:13</a>- “蜜蜂”阳台也不怕的避暑好物</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a>- 夏日透心凉的秘方原来是它！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2910">48:30</a>- 剧透开始！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2987">49:47</a>- 剧透结束~</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3150">52:30</a>- 五星推荐就是它！麦琪含泪推荐！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>收听方式</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>目前本节目在：网易云音乐/小宇宙，都可以收听啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>努力周更！欢迎订阅~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期相关</span></strong></p><span></span><ol><span>  </span><li><span>一.秋葵的品牌</span></li><span></span></ol><span></span><p><span>1、多加点葱shalom</span></p><span></span><p><span>二、防晒、美白、防蚊好物推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>1、AYURA 蓝管防晒霜</span></p><span></span><p><span>2、雅诗兰黛的线雕防晒</span></p><span></span><p><span>3、兰蔻防晒</span></p><span></span><p><span>4、OLAY的美白系列产品</span></p><span></span><p><span>5、vape防蚊灯</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flz7psT-VpRcWLfJA5MGznQp4oYS.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>三、相关书籍</span></p><span></span><ol><span>  </span><li><span>1.《替身（another）》 【日】绫辻行人著 人民文学出版社</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>2.《十角馆事件》 【日】绫辻行人著 新星出版社</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>3.《钟表馆事件》 【日】绫辻行人著 新星出版社</span></li><span></span></ol><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmfGusKAo2u27wL9j5PEivdj0Yj7.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
