  <item>
    <title>EP.04重生之我在台偶骂李大仁</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/665342a94efbc0c3dc2c2e56</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">665342a94efbc0c3dc2c2e56</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 May 2024 14:09:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>@秋葵大人 -期待转型的“甜心教主”</span></p><span></span><p><span>@奥麦琪不骄傲 -剑走偏锋的“恶毒女二”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>六一即将来临，偏爱帅哥的我们暂且放下了动画片，本期节目好好聊了聊童年看过的那些偶像剧！什么离谱情节当年却错以为是浪漫开始？又是什么犀利剧情令两位主播义愤填膺！更没想到大仁哥竟会这样出现在我们的聊天里！看偶像剧长大的大家，欢迎收听~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期节目 两位主播无脑花痴时间稍多，毕竟都是帅哥，请大家多多包涵！】</span></p><span></span><p><span>-时间线-</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a>- 遵纪守法从你我做起！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a>- 恶作剧之吻走进现实？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1061">17:41</a>- 伴侣选择的世纪难题！（吓到结巴）</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1358">22:38</a>- “爱自己”VS“爱别人”</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1845">30:45</a>- 即使09年还在上初二，也推荐你现在看看这部哦</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a>- 当年嗑过的CP再次击中我们</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2495">41:35</a>- 极限二选一，你会怎么选？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2755">45:55</a>- 爱可以是无尽的海，爱情也许是有边界的爱</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3440">57:20</a>- 秋葵教授小课堂：异性朋友社交指南</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期相关</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《恶作剧之吻》</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoYFKuqulhFyRE1QsUc-XewLfXEH.png"></p><span></span><p><span>《败犬女王》</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmflFLsyA2ArELNER6slDvWdAGg-.png"></p><span></span><p><span>《烈爱伤痕》</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjuEehm2arjafA3yRoXQEUD4pDQP.png"></p><span></span><p><span>《犀利人妻》</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu3U-VCpJUqVkmXrBSKJ4KfAA6_m.png"></p>]]></description>
